            <!-- FAQ -->
            <section class="section o_we_snippet o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="FAQ" id="faq">
              <div class="sv-container">
                <div class="sectionHead">
                  <h2>FAQ</h2>
                  <p>Quick answers before we start.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="faq">
                  <details class="faqItem" open="open">
                    <summary>What types of companies do you work with?</summary>
                    <p>Startups, SMBs, and scale-ups: B2B, e-commerce, and services. The key is having a minimum level of traction.</p>
                  </details>
                  <details class="faqItem">
                    <summary>How long before we see results?</summary>
                    <p>Often quick wins within 10–14 days. Structural results are typically measured over 30–90 days.</p>
                  </details>
                  <details class="faqItem">
                    <summary>Do you also handle implementation?</summary>
                    <p>Yes: workshops + implementation (CRM, dashboards, processes, pages). Everything is documented for the team.</p>
